* Lab 3 - Ex04 (b): complementary NPN/PNP emitter follower
V1 vcc 0 12
V2 vee 0 -12
V3 in 0 SINE(0 5 1k)
Q1 vcc in out QN
Q2 vee in out QP
RL out 0 100
.tran 0 5m 0 5u
* models
.model D1N4148 D(Is=2.52n Rs=0.568 N=1.752 Cjo=4p M=0.4 Tt=20n)
